# The build context is the repo root, and the repo root carries 4.2GB of
# vendored MCP servers plus two virtualenvs. Everything the image needs is
# named back in, so the default here is to exclude.
*

!server/api/**
!server/bq/**
!docker/package.json
!docker/service.sh
!submodule/mirage/integ/server/kit/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/server/gws/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/server/notion/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/server/github/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/server/hf_hub/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/prisma/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/fixtures/notion/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/fixtures/github/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/fixtures/hf-hub/**
!submodule/mirage/integ/fixtures/hf-mcp/**

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
